  "application": {
    "label": "Blender",
    "purpose": "Build editable 3D assets, material and procedural node graphs, hierarchy, rigged motion, bounded physics and product presentation frames with independently checked geometry handoffs. Author scientific mesh fields, multiple UV maps, seam unwrap and texture-atlas packing with explicit prototype sharing. Reuse typed object, selected asset-part and whole-collection geometry in procedural graphs. Edit selected mesh topology with ordered extrusion, inset, triangulation, loop bridging and plane cuts before fields and procedural reuse. Construct editable multi-spline Bezier/NURBS paths, planar fills, profile sweeps and taper dependencies. Choose Cycles, EEVEE or Workbench rendering with explicit display transforms, technical shading and distinct object/material/attribute colours. Preview captured colour or scientific images independently of shader appearance with named active UV maps. Assign named material regions to Mesh faces, classic splines and text characters, with explicit shared DATA layouts and independent linked Object palettes. Reuse layered artist finishes with local image sampler roles, packed scalar maps, tangent/object/world normals, coat/sheen/subsurface/transmission/thin-film layers, physical displacement and explicit renderer applicability.",
